| data_loader.py | A1 | icbf_real.csv | icbf_clean.csv, DataFrame(130×19) |
| preprocessing.py | A2 | DataFrame(130×19) | X_normalized ndarray(130×17), minmax_scaler.pkl |
| vae.py | A3 | X_normalized(130×17) + year labels | X_augmented DataFrame(650×19, with county+year+variant_id), CVAE weights |
| pca_pillars.py | A4 | X_augmented(650×17) | standard_scaler.pkl, W loadings(17×4), Z_augmented(650×4), Z_real(130×4), pillar_scores_augmented.csv |
| scoring.py | A5 | X_sc_augmented, X_sc_real, J_k, w_jk, PCA variance ratios | sustainability_scores.csv (130 real rows), sustainability_scores_augmented.csv (650 rows), score_params.pkl with variance weights and 0-100 scale |
