| stgnn.py | A7 + A7b | pillar_scores_augmented, sustainability_scores_augmented, edge_index | stgnn_eval_weights.pt (A7: 2021-2024 train / 2025 real test) + stgnn_forecast_weights.pt (A7b: full-data fit with 2025 included as target) |
